        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "6330952c-b84b-599b-bd14-c14789fa09b8",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jing Tian, Jackie Chan, Ding Sheng, Jiang Zhuoyuan, Oho Ou\n- Works: The Warring States, Special ID, Police Story 2013, Fist & Faith, Police Story film series\n- Topics: Chinese film, acting roles, film direction\n\nFacts:\n- Jing Tian was born on 21 July 1988 and is a Chinese actress.\n- Jing Tian is known for her role in the war epic The Warring States, which was released in 2011.\n- In 2013, Jing Tian appeared in the action films Special ID and Police Story 2013.\n- Police Story 2013, also known as Police Story: Lockdown, is a 2013 Chinese-Hong Kong action crime thriller film.\n- Ding Sheng directed and wrote Police Story 2013.\n- Jackie Chan starred in Police Story 2013, which was another reboot of the Police Story film series.\n- Fist & Faith is a Chinese coming-of-age film directed by Jiang Zhuoyuan.\n- Fist & Faith stars Jing Tian and Oho Ou.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "ef305b92-fb90-5383-86a2-fa9b2397ae96",
        "text": "Page: Jing Tian. Sentence: Jing Tian (born 21 July 1988) is a Chinese actress.\nPage: Jing Tian. Sentence: She is known for her roles in war epic \"The Warring States\" (2011) and the action films \"Special ID\" and \"Police Story 2013\" (both in 2013).\nPage: Police Story 2013. Sentence: Police Story 2013 (also known as Police Story: Lockdown) is a 2013 Chinese-Hong Kong action crime thriller film directed and written by Ding Sheng, and starring Jackie Chan in another reboot of the \"Police Story\" film series.\nPage: Fist &amp; Faith. Sentence: Fist & Faith (Chinese: 青禾男高) is a Chinese coming-of-age film directed by Jiang Zhuoyuan, starring Jing Tian and Oho Ou.",
